Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我独自升级 第二季\N-起于暗影-》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经过多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概3小时左右…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面大概已经过了3天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红色传送口内的环境\N可是非常严酷的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个程肖宇八成也挂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害我白跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个程肖宇不是白虎公会的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会跟你的攻击队一起进入传送口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我说\N想看看C级任务是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才带他过来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会这么说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这次又在打什么主意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟你从以前\N就很擅长发掘新鲜事物嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄东树
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的手给我放开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在命令我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你这个\N小小国家里的一个公会长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟…糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不快点阻止他们的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会演变成S级猎人间的冲突的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想打是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为太冷…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有装备的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就不会输…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才在想说为何没看到半只白熊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难不成…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那群E级的家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不可能有这种实力…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是白鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有白鬼在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是两位没有先收起力道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的手臂可能就已经断了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道黄猎人你是在怀疑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但大约在两个月前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有再度对程猎人进行魔力探测
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的确是E级猎人没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,监察科在调查过后得出结论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也确认了黄东石猎人\N是命丧于魔兽之手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们"对外"的说法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是显而易见的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看动手杀人的\N是那个刘晨建设的少爷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你又为何要追杀程猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个借口罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个杀人的借口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个走运的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最了解程猎人实力的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会活着出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我买武器的钱就全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差了一位数欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实力弱小的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,御寒衣物加上毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连帐篷与食物都有…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这群混账
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王猎人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们攻击队全军覆没了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是因为缺乏粮食与装备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁将这些东西藏起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁将所有装备独占
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将其他同伴推向死亡的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍珍姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妳打从一开始就知道了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会换来这一队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是不肯招供\N我就当你们全都是共犯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我数到3 自己乖乖向我坦承
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-2\N-犯人就是那个家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才是把同伴推向死亡的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然还让麻烦跟了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解除隐身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种强大气息是藏不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙 是冰精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还数量众多…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是BOSS吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这群垃圾之中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然还真的有还算中用的家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是在说我们都是垃圾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(喔…还真是令人惊讶)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 你听得懂我们的语言吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何我会听得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能听得懂魔兽的语言吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是系统带来的影响吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然能对话 那这样正好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这个家伙跟我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我人类之中有个高手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他说想要跟你比个高下…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来没办法三两下就解决他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越来越有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明明不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何会混在人类之中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会一直听到一个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我们去杀了人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而面对你 我却什么都听不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到声音?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是跟系统命令相似的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他面对我时会听不到声音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我变成了"玩家"吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间没有必要战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用两全其美的方式来解决问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你身后的人类交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 我们就保你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这个提议如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何要与人类战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你身后的人类交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 我们就保你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这个提议如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定是会接受的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是打算与我们为敌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在人数上你可是压倒性的劣势呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁是劣势
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是…是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪物出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是黑色的士兵与黑色的白熊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道说这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程猎人 都是你做的吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还想垂死挣扎啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,垂死挣扎…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我们能介入的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他确实有说大话的本钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽说不会消灭\N但每次再生都会消耗法力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的法力也无法持续太久…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且那个BOSS…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么看 他都比我强
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉和耶格利特连手\N也无法轻易打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只靠一般士兵会没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要更强大的战力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫巴鲁卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久没遇到令我如此兴奋的战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后的那个声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏有魔法兵帮我争取了点时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的士兵就只有这点能耐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连人类也背弃你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无聊至极
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王喆…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然不出我所料…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无聊至极
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程肖宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打从一开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就料到我会来了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王者艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从今天起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就叫王者艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺有意思的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就从你开始解决
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动作也太慢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍珍姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人们的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是这个样子的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能当得上猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没见过这种场面…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们…应该不是在作梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不够我打
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站在那边的你还有那个骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都一起上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从你开始解决
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种状况下居然还能避开要害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太小看我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的确很强…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你底下的人就不一定了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你一死 那些小兵就不足为惧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然把武器丢掉 还真是愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王者艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们挺不错的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀光你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胜负已经分晓了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胜负已经分晓了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总算是击倒他了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,适可而止喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前途堪虑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了…是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去传送口外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总算能出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漫长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传送口里差不多过了一个礼拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会留在这里待命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,社长您就先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公会成员被困在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这样自己回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在这里等到天亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人影…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人走出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王喆猎人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白社长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王猎人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高猎人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 你们没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他猎人怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,程猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传送口…消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他的猎人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王喆猎人呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活着出来的 就只有下级猎人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面究竟发生了什么事…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我送妳回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请留步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些事情想请教你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经累了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么话 请你去问公会的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是请求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是命令 甚至是威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让本公会的6名成员下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我身为负责人 必须问你几个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也是我救了那剩下的两人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身为负责人的你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是应该先向我道谢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何说话态度那么差
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在击倒BOSS后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的心情就突然变得很糟…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他应该是觉得相当疲惫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他并不是个坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安科长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你无论如何\N都要将他带进我们公会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我果然没有看走眼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去路上请小心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 肖宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖宇哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天…真的很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:19:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是晚点见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外界连一天都还没过完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果感觉还不赖的报酬\N就只有这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我和他的能力值\N相差太多吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抽了3次 全都失败
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(已失败3次 无法继续抽取)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了一次大白工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是第3次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把早餐吃掉了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去吃了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是用这副打扮过来的吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们路上顺便去接个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉还让你特地来接我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖宇哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那之后有稍微睡一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是 毕竟妳到家时都天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊\N-天亮才回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没睡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖宇哥你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们原来是这种关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妳先睡一下吧 到了再叫妳起来\N-那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你\N-大哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韩小姐她…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没成年呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快出发 早点把事情解决掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 肖宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我独自升级》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.75,0:22:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(#14 你应该没意识到)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(第15话 还有很长的路要走)
